{"id":"615892d0e2bd20ea","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion2-low-set.md","title":"ZFC Recursion2 Low Set","display":"df-zfc-recursion2-low-set — ZFC Recursion2 Low Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-low-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion2-low-set","58-df-zfc-recursion3-low-set"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion2-low-set — ZFC Recursion2 Low Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-low-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion2-low-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-recursion3-low-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion2-low-set — ZFC Recursion2 Low Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9aa91af779dadb4b\" href=\"?note=9aa91af779dadb4b\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f65c348d236e554\" href=\"?note=7f65c348d236e554\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md\">../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9aa91af779dadb4b\" href=\"?note=9aa91af779dadb4b\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)^2\">\\(\\leq_T\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7f65c348d236e554\" href=\"?note=7f65c348d236e554\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md\">../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2LowSet}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2LowSet}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3LowSet}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3LowSet}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}low\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2LowSet}_S(A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists J_A,J_0\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(J_A,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(J_0,\\varnothing)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}{}\\land J_A\\leq_TJ_0\\land J_0\\leq_TJ_A\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}low\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2LowSet}_S(A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists J_A,J_0\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(J_A,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(J_0,\\varnothing)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}{}\\land J_A\\leq_TJ_0\\land J_0\\leq_TJ_A\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}low\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3LowSet}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2LowSet}_S(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}low\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3LowSet}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2LowSet}_S(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus the Turing jump of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> has exactly the degree of the ordinary halting problem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"9aa91af779dadb4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md","status":"resolved","id":"7f65c348d236e554","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"9aa91af779dadb4b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md","status":"resolved","id":"7f65c348d236e554","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\leq_T\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)^2$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_T\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2LowSet}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3LowSet}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}low\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2LowSet}_S(A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nA\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists J_A,J_0\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(J_A,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(J_0,\\varnothing)\\\\\n&\\hspace{35mm}{}\\land J_A\\leq_TJ_0\\land J_0\\leq_TJ_A\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}low\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3LowSet}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2LowSet}_S(A).","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1491,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3234","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion2-low-set.md|58-df-zfc-recursion2-low-set]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9aa91af779dadb4b","7f65c348d236e554"]}